# --- Algebraic-structure classes → Wikidata (concept identity) ------------- #
# Each math: structure class denotes the same concept as its Wikidata item — a
# clean 1:1 identity (the class IS the concept "group", "ring", …), so
# skos:exactMatch at confidence 1.0. All QIDs curl-validated July 2026.

# --- Linear-algebra numeric layer → Wikidata (concept identity) ------------ #
# The bilinear-form / matrix / Gram-matrix / vector / distance numeric layer aligned
# to its Wikidata concepts. A class that IS the concept ("matrix", "bilinear form",
# "symmetric matrix", "Gram matrix") maps by skos:exactMatch; where the GMEOW class is
# the coordinate-vector / general-metric reading and the Wikidata item is the specific
# Euclidean instance, the map is skos:closeMatch. All QIDs curl-validated July 2026.

gmeow:eqMathVector a gmeow:TermEquivalence ;
    gmeow:alignSubject math:Vector ;
    gmeow:alignPredicate skos:closeMatch ;
    gmeow:alignObject wd:Q44528 ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.85 ;
    gmeow:objectLabel "Euclidean vector" ;
    gmeow:comment "math:Vector is the coordinate vector (an element of a vector space in a basis); wd:Q44528 (Euclidean vector) is the geometric magnitude-and-direction reading. closeMatch: the coordinate vector and the geometric vector are close but not invertibly the same object." ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-wikidata.sssom.tsv" .

gmeow:eqMathDistance a gmeow:TermEquivalence ;
    gmeow:alignSubject math:Distance ;
    gmeow:alignPredicate skos:closeMatch ;
    gmeow:alignObject wd:Q847073 ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.85 ;
    gmeow:objectLabel "Euclidean distance" ;
    gmeow:comment "math:Distance is the general norm-induced metric distance; wd:Q847073 (Euclidean distance) is the specific ℓ₂ instance. closeMatch: the general metric distance and the Euclidean special case are close but non-invertible counterparts." ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-wikidata.sssom.tsv" .

# --- Structure-preserving maps → Wikidata (concept identity) --------------- #

gmeow:eqMathQuotient a gmeow:TermEquivalence ;
