# --- Linear algebra and learning (LINEAR-ALGEBRA-AND-LEARNING charter) ------- #
# External anchors to Wikidata (identity where the concept coincides, closeMatch
# where GMEOW's object is a facet of a broader concept). Every QID curl-validated by
# sense (HTTP 200 + English label match). The decomposition/latent/tensor terms with
# no external concept — math:LatentSpace, math:EmbeddingDimension, math:ScoreVector,
# math:LoadingVector, math:ProjectionResidual, math:ResidualInterpretationClaim,
# math:TensorComputationGraph, math:ParameterSpace, math:WeightTensor,
# math:CovarianceOperator, math:AttentionOperation — are GMEOW-original and are left
# unanchored rather than aligned to an approximate match. The OpenMath eigen content
# dictionary (linalgeig) does not resolve, so eigen alignment rides Wikidata alone.

gmeow:eqMathEigendecomposition a gmeow:TermEquivalence ;
    gmeow:alignSubject math:Eigendecomposition ;
    gmeow:alignPredicate skos:closeMatch ;
    gmeow:alignObject wd:Q190524 ;
